.agro/skills.lock.lck
.agro/skills.lock.lck
**/.env*
# agro.json holds every non-secret setting and is tracked; the root dotenv holds
# secrets only. The tracked template is named .example.env so that **/.env*
# needs no exception.
# harness.yaml was removed in 0.4.0. These stay ONE more release so a stale
# local artifact from a pre-0.4.0 checkout is never accidentally committed;
# .agro/scripts/migrate-harness-yaml.sh renames the file to .migrated.
/harness.yaml
/harness.yml
/harness.yaml.migrated
# Derived env artifact the deleted Makefile target generated (not matched by **/.env*)
.devcontainer/.harness.yaml.env
/.agro/config.json
/.agro/config.json
.worktrees/*
!.worktrees/AGENTS.md
projects/*
!projects/AGENTS.md
.claude/worktrees/

# Task folders track only prd.md and prd.json; archive and run artifacts stay local.
.agro/tasks/*
!.agro/tasks/*/
.agro/tasks/*/*
!.agro/tasks/*/prd.md
!.agro/tasks/*/prd.json
!.agro/tasks/AGENTS.md
.agro/tasks/archive/
.agro/logs/*
!.agro/logs/AGENTS.md

# Build artifacts
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Screenshots (keep dir, ignore contents)
**/.claude/screenshots/*
!**/.claude/screenshots/.gitkeep

# Croner runtime artifacts (keep crons/*.md tracked)
crons/.pid
crons/*.log

**/.next
**/.ralph/archives/
**/src/generated/

**/.pnpm-store
**/.claude/plans
**/.agro/plans/
**/.agro/plans/
**/.claude/specs/*
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/auth.json
**/.credentials.json
.prime/agent/sessions/
.prime/agent/telemetry.json

# Hermes project-local runtime state (keep README tracked)
/.hermes/*
!/.hermes/README.md
!/.hermes/hooks/
!/.hermes/config.yaml
!/.hermes/config.yml

**/scheduled_tasks.lock
# Legacy/future workspace package build artifacts
packages/*/build/
packages/*/node_modules/
# Durable repository knowledge (.agro/knowledge/) is TRACKED: source/ and
# patterns/ hold shared synthesis, raw/ holds the immutable external evidence
# those pages cite. Only local/ is ignored — per-machine scratch that /wiki query
# and every plan refuse to read, so a page on one machine can never
# silently inform a plan another machine cannot reproduce.
.agro/knowledge/local/*
!.agro/knowledge/local/README.md
.agro/knowledge/local/*
!.agro/knowledge/local/README.md

# Cron runtime state written by entrypoint.sh's seed_workspace_volume when there
# is no checkout bind. It must never land in a real checkout, so it is ignored on
# every branch.
.agro/.image-seeded
.agro/crons/
.agro/crons/

# RETIRED COMPATIBILITY TOMBSTONE — .agro/memory/ and .agro/memory/ were deleted as a concept; nothing
# writes or reads it. This rule exists only so a stale directory left by a
# pre-0.4.0 checkout can never be committed. Remove it in 0.7.0.
.agro/memory/
.agro/memory/

.agro-migrate.lock
*.migrated
